      "kind": "souvenir",
      "ref": "souvenirs/2026-11-23-meta-ii",
      "slot": "main/4/1",
      "label": "A compiler that can rebuild itself. I put it up high, out of the fish's reach, because it is the only loop here I trust.",
      "added": "2026-11-23"
    },
    {
      "id": "thue-bits-quote",
      "kind": "souvenir",
      "ref": "souvenirs/2026-11-22-thue",
      "slot": "main/3/2",
      "label": "A program allowed to be wrong in a fresh way every run. The fish approves, mostly because it cannot tell which way it",
